30	// old root disappears, every still-common dataset that loses it must be listed
31	// with complete old and new sets, including datasets whose DIRECT upstreams did
32	// not change; datasets present in only one version stay in newDatasets /
33	// removedDatasets and tracing them in the version that lacks them must fail
34	// outright instead of returning a success report.
